WEBVTT

00:31.630 --> 00:35.180
♪ Pink hands so fine ♪

00:35.200 --> 00:38.580
♪ Gold-branded wine ♪

00:38.850 --> 00:44.820
♪ Spring paints willows green;
palace walls can't confine ♪

00:45.980 --> 00:49.610
♪ East wind unfair ♪

00:49.630 --> 00:53.140
♪ Happy times rare ♪

00:53.160 --> 00:56.650
♪ In my heart, sad thoughts throng ♪

00:56.670 --> 01:00.180
♪ We've severed for years long ♪

01:00.200 --> 01:06.260
♪ Wrong, wrong, wrong ♪

01:19.520 --> 01:23.800
Si Jin

01:23.820 --> 01:27.800
Episode 36

01:27.800 --> 01:30.300
(Grand Princess's Mansion)

01:30.300 --> 01:31.260
Although Ms. Duo

01:31.260 --> 01:32.260
always came here

01:32.260 --> 01:33.620
with a veil,

01:34.410 --> 01:36.160
her visits weren't all traceless.

01:36.180 --> 01:37.410
How dare you

01:37.410 --> 01:39.650
watch my mansion.

01:39.900 --> 01:41.450
I also know

01:42.210 --> 01:43.570
Yang Nianzhi

01:43.770 --> 01:45.980
often visits you by stealth.

01:46.130 --> 01:48.280
As hostile as you seem to each other,

01:48.300 --> 01:50.340
you two are quite close.

01:50.570 --> 01:52.730
You helped with his career.

01:53.260 --> 01:56.090
I'm the one who threatens others.

01:56.460 --> 01:58.420
Those who threatened me

01:58.580 --> 02:00.330
all bit the dust.

02:03.330 --> 02:04.840
Don't get me wrong, Aunt.

02:05.860 --> 02:07.610
Had I meant to report you,

02:07.740 --> 02:09.530
I wouldn't have waited until now.

02:10.140 --> 02:11.600
Never have I ever attempted

02:11.620 --> 02:13.170
to act against you.

02:13.620 --> 02:15.610
My mother came from the North.

02:16.020 --> 02:18.030
Father took her in as his consort

02:18.050 --> 02:19.310
to stabilize the border.

02:19.330 --> 02:20.510
I know even if

02:20.530 --> 02:22.190
the Crown Prince's deposed,

02:22.210 --> 02:24.050
and Father appoints someone else,

02:24.210 --> 02:25.840
I'll never be the successor.

02:25.860 --> 02:26.860
Over the years,

02:26.860 --> 02:29.010
he has indulged me when I provoke

02:29.370 --> 02:31.540
the Crown Prince only to push him.

02:32.460 --> 02:33.820
My mother

02:35.020 --> 02:37.380
failed to see through that.

02:37.460 --> 02:40.540
You're sharper than the Crown Prince.

02:40.700 --> 02:42.840
He's harboring Ms. Duo.

02:42.860 --> 02:44.920
That shows he's no longer loyal to you.

02:45.420 --> 02:47.730
Do you still think he's trustworthy?

02:47.980 --> 02:49.440
I see that you've

02:49.460 --> 02:51.500
always been at odds with my mother,

02:51.650 --> 02:53.180
but if you help me become

02:53.180 --> 02:54.570
the new Crown Prince,

02:54.860 --> 02:57.610
I'll pledge my allegiance to you!

02:59.370 --> 03:01.290
Yu Lang has one strength.

03:01.530 --> 03:03.260
His mother died.

03:06.530 --> 03:07.490
Do you dare

03:07.490 --> 03:09.420
kill your mother, Prince Qi?

03:11.650 --> 03:14.170
His Majesty has tons of sons.

03:14.700 --> 03:17.890
Consort Xian can't be the Empress Dowager.

03:19.140 --> 03:20.500
Show him out.

03:20.700 --> 03:22.820
Please, Prince Qi.

03:31.700 --> 03:33.060
Your Highness.

03:35.050 --> 03:37.500
How dare the Crown Prince betray me!

03:38.460 --> 03:40.290
I wonder how much Ms. Duo

03:40.330 --> 03:42.770
has told him about the truth.

03:44.050 --> 03:46.120
If His Majesty finds out,

03:46.140 --> 03:47.980
there will be no way out.

03:48.520 --> 03:52.080
(Crown Prince's Mansion)

03:53.530 --> 03:55.700
Did Aunt kill my mother?

03:56.050 --> 03:58.350
I'm afraid so, Your Highness.

03:58.370 --> 03:59.730
I don't believe it!

04:00.900 --> 04:02.680
She died of leprosy.

04:02.700 --> 04:04.470
All the Imperial Physicians said so.

04:04.490 --> 04:06.550
She couldn't have been poisoned by Aunt.

04:08.980 --> 04:09.860
You made up

04:09.860 --> 04:10.780
such a ridiculous story

04:10.780 --> 04:11.910
to cheat me.

04:11.930 --> 04:13.380
What were you up to?

04:13.620 --> 04:14.790
At this point,

04:14.810 --> 04:16.530
why would I cheat you?

04:18.570 --> 04:19.930
And you!

04:21.050 --> 04:22.650
How audacious of you!

04:22.690 --> 04:24.520
Aunt's been looking everywhere for her

04:24.540 --> 04:26.350
while you've had her harbored at our place.

04:26.370 --> 04:27.490
Are you trying to sow discord

04:27.490 --> 04:29.010
between me and the Grand Princess?

04:29.010 --> 04:30.180
Empress Di entrusted her

04:30.180 --> 04:31.740
to me.

04:31.780 --> 04:32.720
If you don't believe me,

04:32.720 --> 04:34.470
go ask her in the Changning Palace.

04:34.490 --> 04:36.330
Fuqing's blindness is also proof.

04:37.420 --> 04:38.880
There is something else.

04:38.930 --> 04:41.140
You're allergic to walnuts.

04:41.690 --> 04:43.320
After your mother passed away,

04:43.340 --> 04:45.110
someone slipped chopped walnuts

04:45.130 --> 04:46.160
into your desserts,

04:46.180 --> 04:47.470
which almost killed you.

04:47.490 --> 04:49.080
The Grand Princess saved your life

04:49.100 --> 04:51.030
and found that it was Consort Xian's doing.

04:51.050 --> 04:52.350
The truth is

04:52.370 --> 04:54.530
all that was part of her scheme

04:54.930 --> 04:56.470
to set Consort Xian up

04:56.490 --> 04:58.180
and win you over.

04:58.340 --> 04:59.700
Liar!

05:00.100 --> 05:01.230
You're lying!

05:01.250 --> 05:03.770
Impossible! That can't be true!

05:03.810 --> 05:05.200
Aunt couldn't have done that.

05:05.220 --> 05:06.350
No way.

05:06.370 --> 05:07.250
I will have you

05:07.250 --> 05:08.400
thrown into prison

05:08.420 --> 05:09.300
and tortured severely!

05:09.300 --> 05:11.110
- Guards! Guards!
- Your Highness!

05:11.130 --> 05:12.350
Your Highness,

05:12.370 --> 05:14.030
your mother was the Empress

05:14.050 --> 05:15.570
who was worshiped by all,

05:16.100 --> 05:18.550
but she ended up being killed by poison.

05:18.570 --> 05:19.690
If you mistook the killer

05:19.690 --> 05:20.910
as the savior,

05:20.930 --> 05:22.660
how could your mother

05:22.660 --> 05:24.210
rest in peace?

05:25.450 --> 05:27.450
If you seize Ms. Duo,

05:27.660 --> 05:29.500
I'll be killed for sure.

05:29.810 --> 05:31.990
What if our baby grows up

05:32.010 --> 05:33.840
without knowing how his mother died,

05:33.860 --> 05:36.080
and continues to worship the Grand Princess?

05:36.250 --> 05:38.300
Is that what you want to see?

05:55.420 --> 05:56.780
No.

05:57.450 --> 05:58.790
Aunt...

05:58.810 --> 06:00.640
Aunt couldn't have cheated me.

06:00.660 --> 06:02.020
No way.

06:12.340 --> 06:14.200
I didn't get to see the Crown Prince.

06:14.220 --> 06:15.180
The Crown Princess said

06:15.180 --> 06:16.350
he wasn't well enough

06:16.370 --> 06:17.970
to come out.

06:18.540 --> 06:20.090
In the past,

06:20.370 --> 06:21.720
he was

06:21.740 --> 06:23.770
obedient to me.

06:24.490 --> 06:27.740
He'd do whatever I said.

06:28.690 --> 06:30.890
He must've learned from Ms. Duo

06:30.890 --> 06:32.870
about the truth of his mother's death

06:32.890 --> 06:34.860
and betrayed me.

06:35.570 --> 06:37.970
Prince Qi was right.

06:38.130 --> 06:39.450
I'm going to bring Ms. Duo back

06:39.460 --> 06:40.740
from the Crown Prince's Mansion.

06:40.740 --> 06:42.100
No need.

06:42.300 --> 06:43.250
Everyone knows

06:43.250 --> 06:45.200
we're bonded together

06:45.220 --> 06:47.010
like a mother and a son.

06:47.250 --> 06:51.090
Now that he no longer obeys me,

06:53.930 --> 06:55.940
he's worthless.

06:55.980 --> 06:57.490
I'll show him

06:57.490 --> 07:00.330
that he'll reap what he sows.

07:01.560 --> 07:05.560
(Luxurious and Gorgeous)

07:10.980 --> 07:13.410
Greetings, Aunt.

07:13.740 --> 07:15.790
You came fast.

07:15.810 --> 07:17.700
I rushed over as soon as I received

07:17.890 --> 07:19.160
your secret message.

07:19.180 --> 07:21.740
Have some tea.

07:22.660 --> 07:24.700
Last time, after you left,

07:24.810 --> 07:26.820
I pondered over your words.

07:27.780 --> 07:29.140
You know,

07:29.180 --> 07:31.530
your talent and diligence

07:32.010 --> 07:34.770
are superior to the Crown Prince's.

07:35.180 --> 07:37.110
For what it's worth,

07:37.130 --> 07:38.490
I shall

07:39.740 --> 07:42.010
give you a chance.

07:44.540 --> 07:45.900
Thank you, Aunt.

07:53.860 --> 07:56.430
This is the totem of Nanwu's Saintess.

07:56.450 --> 07:59.220
It was spotted

07:59.220 --> 08:00.620
on Princess Yan.

08:02.490 --> 08:04.450
Is she Nanwu's Saintess?

08:07.570 --> 08:09.110
As you know,

08:09.130 --> 08:12.110
His Majesty loathes Nanwu.

08:12.130 --> 08:15.090
Colluding with them is a capital crime.

08:15.660 --> 08:18.180
Not to mention Princess Yan

08:19.250 --> 08:21.690
turns out to be their Saintess.

08:22.820 --> 08:25.860
If you report her to His Majesty,

08:25.980 --> 08:27.920
you'll be eliminating a national threat.

08:27.940 --> 08:30.350
It'll be a great merit for Dazhou

08:30.370 --> 08:31.630
and also

08:31.650 --> 08:34.140
a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity.

08:44.340 --> 08:46.860
Prince Yan and I

08:46.860 --> 08:48.980
are of the same mother.

08:49.130 --> 08:50.870
If I report his wife,

08:50.890 --> 08:51.770
Yu Jin will also

08:51.770 --> 08:53.380
be implicated.

08:53.700 --> 08:54.740
Even my mother and I...

08:54.740 --> 08:56.100
Never mind.

08:56.820 --> 08:59.050
Clearly, your ambition is

09:00.010 --> 09:02.470
no more than empty talk.

09:02.490 --> 09:04.390
You put your brother's wife,

09:04.410 --> 09:06.770
that woman, Jiang Si,

09:07.410 --> 09:10.460
before national security.

09:11.920 --> 09:13.880
(Luxurious and Gorgeous)

09:13.890 --> 09:15.630
No wonder His Majesty

09:15.650 --> 09:17.530
always tells me

09:18.010 --> 09:21.050
you only talk the talk.

09:22.460 --> 09:24.170
He doesn't trust you.

09:29.080 --> 09:32.600
(Prince Yan's Mansion)

09:42.010 --> 09:42.860
Apply it to your skin

09:42.860 --> 09:44.530
and the totem will be gone?

09:45.340 --> 09:46.600
I've tried.

09:46.620 --> 09:48.510
It can only be concealed temporarily,

09:48.530 --> 09:50.270
and it'll reappear soon.

09:50.290 --> 09:52.150
When Aman helped me get changed

09:52.170 --> 09:53.870
after we came home from the streets,

09:53.890 --> 09:55.770
the concealer no longer worked.

09:56.460 --> 09:57.920
But right now,

09:57.940 --> 09:59.470
I have to conceal the totem.

09:59.490 --> 10:01.890
Apply the concealer every day

10:02.130 --> 10:04.010
to never let it out again.

10:04.580 --> 10:06.110
Every day?

10:06.130 --> 10:07.730
Isn't that too much trouble?

10:08.130 --> 10:09.560
No trouble at all.

10:09.580 --> 10:11.230
Leave all the trouble to your husband.

10:11.250 --> 10:12.440
If you don't trouble me,

10:12.460 --> 10:14.320
that'll be my biggest trouble.

10:14.340 --> 10:15.350
So please trouble me

10:15.370 --> 10:17.050
as much as possible.

10:17.250 --> 10:19.110
Stop saying the word "trouble".

10:19.130 --> 10:20.740
I'm lost.

10:20.820 --> 10:21.920
It's disappeared!

10:21.940 --> 10:23.270
Really?

10:23.290 --> 10:24.650
Add more to it.

10:27.860 --> 10:28.920
Is it gone?

10:28.940 --> 10:30.130
It's magical!

10:30.130 --> 10:31.490
All gone.

10:37.160 --> 10:41.040
(Taiji Hall, Tiande Hall)

10:41.290 --> 10:42.630
Mother,

10:42.650 --> 10:44.630
what's the emergency?

10:44.650 --> 10:46.010
There you are.

10:46.650 --> 10:48.010
Read it.

10:49.290 --> 10:51.440
Yesterday, Jin's wife

10:51.460 --> 10:52.720
had her maid

10:52.740 --> 10:54.650
send that to me.

10:54.770 --> 10:56.440
Never in my wildest dreams

10:56.460 --> 10:58.580
did I think the Grand Princess

10:59.130 --> 11:00.290
would depict Jin

11:00.290 --> 11:02.010
as a cursed prince.

11:04.460 --> 11:06.290
She held a grudge against me

11:07.250 --> 11:09.740
and came up with a dirty plot

11:09.820 --> 11:12.320
to separate me and my son.

11:12.340 --> 11:14.560
How wildly audacious of her.

11:14.580 --> 11:15.870
Ms. Xu's testimony

11:15.890 --> 11:17.740
told the whole truth.

11:18.370 --> 11:21.390
First, she set Yu Jin up.

11:21.410 --> 11:23.150
Then she tried to kill Jiang Si.

11:23.170 --> 11:25.040
She survived by sheer luck.

11:25.060 --> 11:26.240
Or she would've died of poison

11:26.240 --> 11:27.230
like her mother.

11:27.250 --> 11:28.860
The testimony also said

11:29.010 --> 11:31.260
the Grand Princess colluded with Nanwu.

11:31.940 --> 11:33.890
With this testimony,

11:34.290 --> 11:36.050
I don't think

11:36.490 --> 11:39.150
His Majesty will still cover for her.

11:39.170 --> 11:40.320
But were it

11:40.340 --> 11:42.340
able to bring her down for good,

11:43.060 --> 11:45.410
why not hand it in to Father,

11:46.220 --> 11:47.680
but you?

11:47.700 --> 11:49.110
Between Jin and his wife,

11:49.130 --> 11:50.510
he grew up in the South

11:50.530 --> 11:52.150
while she's from a declining clan.

11:52.170 --> 11:53.800
They have no roots in Ling'an

11:53.820 --> 11:54.960
and no support in the court.

11:54.980 --> 11:56.840
They gave such vital evidence

11:56.860 --> 11:59.080
to me, not the Empress

11:59.100 --> 12:01.470
because they trusted me.

12:01.490 --> 12:02.370
After all,

12:02.370 --> 12:03.920
Jin is my son.

12:03.940 --> 12:05.810
Ms. Xu can change her testimony.

12:05.830 --> 12:07.840
Those of Astronomy
responsible for Jin's divination

12:07.840 --> 12:08.840
might've died.

12:08.860 --> 12:11.260
Once Aunt makes Ms. Xu retract her words,

12:11.860 --> 12:13.690
we'll be guilty of a frame-up.

12:19.290 --> 12:21.680
Not this, not that.

12:21.700 --> 12:23.530
Anything can hold you back

12:23.530 --> 12:24.770
and drag your feet.

12:24.770 --> 12:26.390
Who did you take after that?

12:26.410 --> 12:27.740
Will I be able to see you

12:27.740 --> 12:29.270
bring down that witch before death?

12:29.290 --> 12:31.040
You aren't half as bold as Jin.

12:31.060 --> 12:32.720
He dared beat the Crown Prince

12:32.740 --> 12:34.930
and fight that witch head-on

12:35.010 --> 12:36.930
not to marry her daughter.

12:37.060 --> 12:38.270
But look at you!

12:38.290 --> 12:39.200
Mother,

12:39.220 --> 12:41.130
seizing the throne is the riskiest.

12:41.370 --> 12:43.010
One misstep can kill everyone in my house

12:43.010 --> 12:44.230
and in this hall.

12:44.250 --> 12:45.530
I'm trying to be thorough

12:45.530 --> 12:46.840
and cautious.

12:46.860 --> 12:48.620
How is that wrong?

12:55.490 --> 12:57.260
Here comes the chance,

12:58.130 --> 12:59.290
but you're too timid

12:59.290 --> 13:01.100
to do anything.

13:02.060 --> 13:04.220
Clearly, I can't count on you.

13:19.890 --> 13:21.250
Your Highness!

13:23.980 --> 13:26.620
Your Highness, what happened?

13:30.530 --> 13:32.340
Am I really inferior to Jin?

13:33.980 --> 13:35.340
It was spotted

13:35.370 --> 13:38.100
on Princess Yan.

13:38.250 --> 13:41.150
If you report her to His Majesty,

13:41.170 --> 13:43.600
it'll be a great merit for Dazhou

13:43.620 --> 13:44.870
and also

13:44.890 --> 13:47.260
a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity.

13:52.820 --> 13:54.410
I've been feeling guilty

13:54.770 --> 13:59.260
about what happened to Yu.

14:04.940 --> 14:07.340
I'm not your enemy.

14:08.290 --> 14:10.220
When the accident happened,

14:11.010 --> 14:12.980
I was unable to lend a hand.

14:13.860 --> 14:16.930
But if you acted against me,

14:17.290 --> 14:19.600
wouldn't you have one more foe

14:19.620 --> 14:21.380
and one less ally?

14:23.170 --> 14:26.380
Ever since we suffered misfortune,

14:27.700 --> 14:29.960
you've been staying as far

14:29.980 --> 14:32.740
as you can from our family.

14:32.980 --> 14:37.040
Why invite me to drinks today?

14:37.060 --> 14:40.650
What do you want? Just say it.

14:40.860 --> 14:43.720
Your biggest enemy isn't me,

14:43.740 --> 14:45.140
but Jiang Si.

14:46.460 --> 14:49.040
She was the one who reported Yi

14:49.060 --> 14:50.770
and talked Jiang Qian

14:50.770 --> 14:52.620
into divorcing him.

14:52.700 --> 14:55.580
Also, she made His Majesty

14:56.130 --> 14:59.860
try the case and sentence your son to death.

15:00.650 --> 15:03.620
She is your sworn enemy.

15:03.740 --> 15:06.690
Don't you hate her?

15:06.980 --> 15:09.350
Yes, of course!

15:09.370 --> 15:11.340
I wish I could cut them into pieces!

15:11.340 --> 15:13.890
I wish they'd be torn limb from limb!

15:14.060 --> 15:15.930
Now, there's a chance

15:16.010 --> 15:17.320
for you to take revenge

15:17.340 --> 15:19.050
aboveboard.

15:19.620 --> 15:22.220
You lost Princess Mingyue.

15:23.650 --> 15:25.740
Don't you also hate them?

15:26.290 --> 15:27.650
I see.

15:28.220 --> 15:30.530
You want me

15:31.100 --> 15:34.140
to be your sword, huh?

15:34.170 --> 15:37.270
Hear me out before you decide

15:37.290 --> 15:39.100
if it's worth it

15:39.820 --> 15:41.500
to be my sword.

15:44.250 --> 15:45.390
Your Highness,

15:45.410 --> 15:46.960
Prince Qi came to see you.

15:47.490 --> 15:48.800
Let him wait.

15:48.820 --> 15:50.180
Yes.

16:00.880 --> 16:05.400
(Grand Princess's Mansion)

16:08.980 --> 16:10.340
(Mingyue, )

16:10.890 --> 16:12.580
(the day to avenge your death)

16:12.580 --> 16:14.380
(has finally come.)

16:14.490 --> 16:15.680
(I'll)

16:15.700 --> 16:17.620
(dress myself up)

16:18.340 --> 16:19.720
(as loudly as)

16:19.740 --> 16:21.810
(the day I saw you marry.)

17:08.020 --> 17:09.380
(Mingyue, )

17:09.580 --> 17:11.410
(I will not let go)

17:11.450 --> 17:12.810
(a single one)

17:12.890 --> 17:15.380
(of those who killed you.)

17:23.130 --> 17:24.490
Your Majesty,

17:24.730 --> 17:26.350
the Grand Princess is outside.

17:26.370 --> 17:27.730
Let her in.

17:28.540 --> 17:31.690
Summon the Grand Princess.

17:37.410 --> 17:38.840
It's been a while.

17:38.860 --> 17:41.620
I came to pay my respects to you, Brother.

17:42.450 --> 17:43.560
Rongyang,

17:43.580 --> 17:45.540
you look much better.

17:45.890 --> 17:47.560
That's quite a relief.

17:47.580 --> 17:49.350
You have to squeeze time

17:49.370 --> 17:51.080
from your already tight schedule

17:51.100 --> 17:52.110
for me.

17:52.130 --> 17:53.520
I'm sorry for troubling you.

17:53.540 --> 17:54.900
Don't mention it.

17:55.060 --> 17:56.480
You're my sister.

17:56.500 --> 17:58.500
I ought to go through this difficult time

17:58.500 --> 18:00.240
with you.

18:00.260 --> 18:01.710
Thank you, Brother.

18:01.730 --> 18:02.650
It's too hot

18:02.650 --> 18:04.390
and sweltering today.

18:04.410 --> 18:06.000
I brought you

18:06.020 --> 18:08.670
our favorite drink in childhood,

18:08.690 --> 18:10.800
the cold perilla drink.

18:10.820 --> 18:12.240
Add some ice.

18:12.260 --> 18:14.970
It'll taste refreshing.

18:15.060 --> 18:16.860
It's so thoughtful of you.

18:17.170 --> 18:19.480
Prince Qi requests an audience.

18:19.500 --> 18:20.860
Send him in.

18:21.500 --> 18:23.800
I'll take my leave.

18:23.820 --> 18:25.210
We're family.

18:25.300 --> 18:26.660
You may stay.

18:31.860 --> 18:34.020
Greetings, Father.

18:34.100 --> 18:35.650
Greetings, Grand Princess.

18:42.410 --> 18:44.020
Who taught you that?

18:44.780 --> 18:45.770
I meant to teach you

18:45.770 --> 18:46.780
a few last-minute tricks.

18:46.780 --> 18:48.300
Now, I don't have to.

18:48.500 --> 18:49.670
I had

18:49.690 --> 18:52.410
(Before the Flowers)
a wonderful master.

18:55.020 --> 18:57.000
There are two things for sure.

18:57.020 --> 18:58.480
This person is

18:58.500 --> 18:59.860
as skilled as me.

19:00.370 --> 19:01.890
Besides,

19:02.100 --> 19:03.670
someone can't

19:03.690 --> 19:05.670
forget that person.

19:05.690 --> 19:07.340
My master

19:07.370 --> 19:09.580
is called Yu Qi.

19:11.130 --> 19:12.600
I know him all too well.

19:12.620 --> 19:14.490
Isn't he me in the dream?

19:14.540 --> 19:15.870
This is so unfair.

19:15.890 --> 19:17.430
I want to do these things with you,

19:17.450 --> 19:18.890
but he's beaten me to them.

19:18.890 --> 19:20.630
- Are you jealous?
- Quite so, indeed.

19:20.650 --> 19:21.710
Both of them are you.

19:21.730 --> 19:22.840
It's not the same!

19:22.860 --> 19:24.220
Chief!

19:25.300 --> 19:26.900
Chief, My Lady.

19:26.920 --> 19:28.410
The Grand Princess entered the Palace.

19:28.410 --> 19:29.610
Prince Qi followed right after.

19:29.610 --> 19:31.170
- Him too?
- Yes.

19:31.370 --> 19:33.780
What must come cannot be avoided.

19:34.860 --> 19:35.800
Zhang.

19:35.820 --> 19:36.840
Yes, Father.

19:36.860 --> 19:39.870
I read your report on tax

19:39.890 --> 19:40.950
and corvee.

19:40.970 --> 19:43.670
It was beautifully written

19:43.690 --> 19:45.390
but quite shallow.

19:45.410 --> 19:47.170
It was mere empty talk.

19:49.930 --> 19:51.290
What's this for?

19:52.100 --> 19:54.970
I'm handing in a secret report!

20:16.060 --> 20:17.580
If the Grand Princess went

20:17.580 --> 20:19.650
for Nanwu's Saintess,

20:19.970 --> 20:22.340
Father would summon us soon.

20:24.060 --> 20:25.420
Listen,

20:26.370 --> 20:27.450
leave through the back gate.

20:27.450 --> 20:29.240
Tell others you need to worship ancestors.

20:29.260 --> 20:30.370
Lingshui and Nanwu

20:30.370 --> 20:31.410
are in the same direction.

20:31.410 --> 20:32.670
No one will suspect you.

20:32.690 --> 20:34.050
Also,

20:34.300 --> 20:36.300
bring with you the pendant from me

20:36.620 --> 20:37.710
and go to the Chiyu Cavalry.

20:37.730 --> 20:38.870
If I leave like this,

20:38.890 --> 20:40.430
others will think I escaped,

20:40.450 --> 20:42.390
and you'll be guilty of collaboration.

20:42.410 --> 20:43.780
The great merits

20:43.930 --> 20:46.300
you gained from years of battling

20:46.340 --> 20:48.260
have finally cleared your name

20:48.260 --> 20:49.430
as a cursed prince.

20:49.450 --> 20:51.300
Are you going to give all that up?

20:56.020 --> 20:57.860
I don't care about anything

20:58.860 --> 21:00.300
but your safety.

21:00.780 --> 21:02.140
Listen to me,

21:02.620 --> 21:03.980
go now.

21:06.300 --> 21:07.660
Go!

21:09.580 --> 21:10.520
Long Dan,

21:10.540 --> 21:12.170
get her out of town!

21:12.300 --> 21:13.660
Yes.

21:30.500 --> 21:33.970
Greetings, Your Majesty.

21:34.020 --> 21:36.060
Show Marquis Changxing that letter.

21:37.740 --> 21:39.240
I heard

21:39.260 --> 21:41.900
you had dug deep into Nanwu

21:41.920 --> 21:43.860
after losing your son.

21:43.970 --> 21:45.190
Do you

21:45.210 --> 21:47.150
recognize this totem?

21:47.170 --> 21:48.390
Marquis Changxing,

21:48.410 --> 21:50.040
if you know anything,

21:50.060 --> 21:51.930
do tell us.

21:52.170 --> 21:53.530
Yes.

21:55.820 --> 21:57.180
Your Majesty,

21:57.580 --> 22:00.670
this is the totem of Nanwu's Saintess!

22:00.690 --> 22:03.210
It's Nanwu's top secret.

22:03.210 --> 22:04.820
I searched

22:04.820 --> 22:06.180
long and hard

22:06.260 --> 22:08.390
only to see it once in a classified scroll.

22:08.410 --> 22:10.410
Your Majesty, how did you get it?

22:10.540 --> 22:12.060
A few days ago,

22:12.100 --> 22:15.170
I found it from a captured Nanwu's spy.

22:16.450 --> 22:17.760
Does it

22:17.780 --> 22:20.040
only appear on Nanwu's Saintess?

22:20.060 --> 22:22.110
That classified scroll said

22:22.130 --> 22:24.240
the Saintess was born with the totem

22:24.260 --> 22:25.600
given by the heavens.

22:25.620 --> 22:27.320
No one else would have it.

22:27.340 --> 22:29.540
That Nanwu's spy told the truth.

22:30.100 --> 22:32.000
Once Princess Yan arrives,

22:32.020 --> 22:33.890
we'll find out.

22:35.780 --> 22:36.680
Are you ready, My Lady?

22:36.680 --> 22:38.240
We're running out of time!

22:42.690 --> 22:44.890
My Lady, can we go?

22:46.300 --> 22:47.660
My Lady!

22:49.930 --> 22:50.800
My Lady!

22:50.820 --> 22:52.180
Where's she?

22:54.860 --> 22:56.220
Oh no!

22:57.800 --> 23:02.360
(Before the Flowers)

23:02.370 --> 23:03.480
Prince Yan,

23:03.500 --> 23:04.760
His Majesty

23:04.780 --> 23:06.890
summons you and Princess Yan.

23:07.340 --> 23:10.020
Prince Yan has arrived!

23:16.130 --> 23:18.540
Greetings, Father.

23:18.860 --> 23:19.800
Yu Jin,

23:19.820 --> 23:21.890
I'll only ask you once.

23:22.340 --> 23:24.170
Be honest with me.

23:24.210 --> 23:25.560
What is it, Father?

23:25.580 --> 23:26.840
Is Jiang Si

23:26.860 --> 23:28.860
Nanwu's Saintess or not?

23:28.880 --> 23:29.870
What makes you say that?

23:29.890 --> 23:31.630
- Answer me.
- Pure nonsense.

23:31.650 --> 23:33.140
Really?

23:33.340 --> 23:34.370
His Majesty

23:34.370 --> 23:36.300
summoned you and your wife.

23:36.450 --> 23:38.690
Why did you come alone?

23:39.410 --> 23:41.080
She went home to worship her ancestors.

23:41.100 --> 23:44.890
What a coincidence, huh?

23:46.340 --> 23:48.100
What's that supposed to mean?

23:49.210 --> 23:51.650
Your Majesty, Princess Yan is outside.

23:52.020 --> 23:53.380
Send her in.

24:11.210 --> 24:12.670
Greetings, Father.

24:12.690 --> 24:14.410
Sorry, I'm late.

24:15.690 --> 24:16.800
Jiang Si,

24:16.820 --> 24:18.380
I received a tip-off

24:18.500 --> 24:20.820
saying you're Nanwu's Saintess.

24:20.890 --> 24:22.710
What do you have to say?

24:22.730 --> 24:24.100
Father,

24:24.650 --> 24:26.630
I was born and raised in Ling'an.

24:26.650 --> 24:28.240
The furthest I've been is Lingshui.

24:28.260 --> 24:30.100
How could I be Nanwu's Saintess?

24:30.730 --> 24:32.600
It's utter nonsense.

24:32.620 --> 24:34.280
Trust me, Father.

24:34.300 --> 24:36.670
Clearly, you two are on the same page.

24:36.690 --> 24:38.110
You came prepared, didn't you?

24:38.130 --> 24:40.450
Why are you throwing dirt on us, Aunt?

24:40.820 --> 24:42.870
Father, the Saintess

24:42.890 --> 24:43.890
is the chosen one

24:43.890 --> 24:45.080
by Nanwu.

24:45.100 --> 24:46.910
It doesn't have to be their citizen

24:46.930 --> 24:49.520
or someone who's been there.

24:49.540 --> 24:52.840
How can we know for sure?

24:52.860 --> 24:54.380
In my humble opinion,

24:54.500 --> 24:56.170
the totem doesn't lie.

24:56.210 --> 24:57.910
Father, please check

24:57.930 --> 24:59.350
the back of Princess Yan's neck

24:59.370 --> 25:00.970
for that totem.

25:00.970 --> 25:01.950
No!

25:01.970 --> 25:03.860
She's my princess.

25:03.970 --> 25:05.760
She can't be checked in public

25:05.780 --> 25:07.690
because of sheer nonsense.

25:07.860 --> 25:09.670
Don't you want to clear your name?

25:09.690 --> 25:11.000
This is the best chance.

25:11.020 --> 25:12.730
If you insist, Father,

25:12.860 --> 25:14.630
I'll let them check me.

25:14.650 --> 25:16.240
But if no totem is found,

25:16.260 --> 25:17.840
please show no mercy to those

25:17.860 --> 25:19.100
who framed me, Father.

25:19.100 --> 25:20.460
Sure.

25:20.820 --> 25:23.580
Have her checked in the Imperial Study.

25:33.730 --> 25:34.840
Your Majesty,

25:34.860 --> 25:36.970
we found no totem on Princess Yan.

25:37.170 --> 25:38.100
She doesn't have it,

25:38.100 --> 25:39.760
so she can't be the Saintess.

25:39.860 --> 25:41.280
Your Majesty,

25:41.300 --> 25:43.450
please punish those who framed her.

25:44.540 --> 25:46.890
Father, I...

25:47.340 --> 25:48.700
Brother,

25:49.410 --> 25:51.380
rumor has it that heat

25:51.580 --> 25:53.240
will make that totem

25:53.260 --> 25:54.840
show more clearly.

25:54.860 --> 25:56.170
I wonder

25:56.170 --> 25:57.150
if that's true.

25:57.170 --> 25:58.080
Father,

25:58.100 --> 25:59.240
she's been checked once.

25:59.260 --> 26:00.390
Why not check thoroughly

26:00.410 --> 26:01.410
just in case?

26:01.410 --> 26:02.750
In case of what? She has no totem.

26:02.750 --> 26:05.000
Rongyang, check her yourself.

26:05.020 --> 26:06.380
Yes.

26:22.260 --> 26:23.650
Pull down her dress.

26:42.260 --> 26:43.620
Jiang Si,

26:43.650 --> 26:46.140
you really are Nanwu's Saintess.

26:48.890 --> 26:51.860
Jiang Si is indeed Nanwu's Saintess!

26:59.820 --> 27:01.520
Princess Fuqing, you can't go in.

27:01.540 --> 27:02.480
Why?

27:02.500 --> 27:04.280
Look at you, Jin!

27:04.300 --> 27:05.370
This is the wife

27:05.370 --> 27:06.430
you chose,

27:06.450 --> 27:07.820
who betrayed our state

27:07.820 --> 27:09.190
and colluded with Nanwu.

27:09.210 --> 27:11.930
Father, she couldn't have been a traitor.

27:19.260 --> 27:21.490
Your Majesty, Mr. Zhen is outside.

27:21.730 --> 27:23.090
Send him in.

27:29.650 --> 27:32.040
Zhen Heng greets you, Your Majesty.

27:32.060 --> 27:34.000
I'm glad you're here.

27:34.020 --> 27:36.140
Let's try this case together.

27:37.210 --> 27:38.570
Jiang Si,

27:38.620 --> 27:39.570
Prince Yan spoke for you

27:39.570 --> 27:41.320
at the risk of covering

27:41.340 --> 27:42.600
for a traitor.

27:42.620 --> 27:43.910
How will you defend yourself?

27:43.930 --> 27:45.290
Your Majesty,

27:46.930 --> 27:48.290
I implore you

27:48.370 --> 27:50.080
to think it through.

27:50.100 --> 27:51.560
Marquis Changxing

27:51.580 --> 27:53.580
was quite close to Nanwu.

27:53.620 --> 27:54.840
His son

27:54.860 --> 27:56.240
was found

27:56.260 --> 27:58.430
carrying their secret drug, Surreal Wander.

27:58.450 --> 28:00.620
Even he didn't know

28:00.620 --> 28:02.390
how to bring out the totem.

28:02.410 --> 28:03.450
How did the Grand Princess

28:03.450 --> 28:05.170
find out so easily

28:05.300 --> 28:07.250
on the pretext of rumor?

28:07.300 --> 28:08.260
Would anyone

28:08.260 --> 28:09.600
in this hall believe

28:09.620 --> 28:11.210
she didn't collaborate

28:11.210 --> 28:12.560
with Nanwu?

28:12.580 --> 28:13.650
I was born and raised

28:13.650 --> 28:14.670
in Dazhou.

28:14.690 --> 28:17.450
I'd never do anything harmful to our state.

28:17.650 --> 28:19.010
Your Majesty,

28:20.170 --> 28:23.670
my son's case has been concluded.

28:23.690 --> 28:25.390
I followed you

28:25.410 --> 28:28.210
fighting here and there my entire life.

28:28.450 --> 28:29.320
I've devoted myself

28:29.340 --> 28:31.430
to you and Dazhou.

28:31.450 --> 28:33.780
I swear, Your Majesty!

28:35.300 --> 28:36.860
Rise, Marquis Changxing.

28:43.340 --> 28:44.350
Brother,

28:44.370 --> 28:46.520
I'd like to call a witness.

28:46.540 --> 28:47.390
Who is it?

28:47.410 --> 28:48.860
A dead man.

28:49.100 --> 28:50.540
Bring him in.

29:01.410 --> 29:02.770
Sang Qi?

29:03.060 --> 29:04.730
Didn't you die?

29:04.890 --> 29:06.250
Yes.

29:06.340 --> 29:08.450
Didn't he already die?

29:09.060 --> 29:10.420
Jiang Si,

29:10.580 --> 29:13.100
you know him well, don't you?

29:13.300 --> 29:15.840
Zhen Heng, who is he?

29:15.860 --> 29:18.380
He worked for the Nightingale of Nanwu.

29:18.540 --> 29:19.910
His name is Sang Qi.

29:19.930 --> 29:22.190
He had been seized by Prince Yan.

29:22.210 --> 29:23.570
Later,

29:23.930 --> 29:25.520
he somehow died of poison.

29:25.540 --> 29:27.760
How come he's here and alive?

29:27.780 --> 29:28.870
I'm also confused.

29:28.890 --> 29:30.320
Back in the Capital Security Office,

29:30.340 --> 29:31.950
Prince Yan and I

29:31.970 --> 29:33.560
checked his body together

29:33.580 --> 29:35.690
and confirmed his death.

29:36.350 --> 29:38.730
Your Majesty, investigation shows

29:38.820 --> 29:39.970
the last person he saw

29:39.970 --> 29:40.840
before he died

29:40.860 --> 29:42.220
was Jiang Si

29:42.260 --> 29:43.600
who held the waist tag

29:43.620 --> 29:45.400
(Capital Security)
of Commandant Yu.

29:45.420 --> 29:46.300
When Speed Guards

29:46.300 --> 29:48.000
were looking for Nanwu's spies earlier,

29:48.020 --> 29:49.580
they caught him again.

29:49.860 --> 29:52.110
This matter involves

29:52.130 --> 29:54.870
Yu Jin and Jiang Si

29:54.890 --> 29:57.620
from the very beginning, right?

30:01.300 --> 30:02.660
Your Majesty,

30:02.690 --> 30:03.950
I can vouch

30:03.970 --> 30:05.130
for Prince Yan,

30:05.130 --> 30:06.240
the then Commandant Yu.

30:06.260 --> 30:08.110
He knows nothing about it.

30:08.130 --> 30:09.670
He caught

30:09.690 --> 30:11.520
Sang Qi himself.

30:11.540 --> 30:13.240
Why would he help him escape?

30:13.260 --> 30:15.760
There must be a misunderstanding.

30:15.780 --> 30:17.600
In that case,

30:17.620 --> 30:20.350
it was Princess Yan,

30:20.370 --> 30:21.730
sorry,

30:23.210 --> 30:25.910
Nanwu's Saintess, Jiang Si

30:25.930 --> 30:27.630
who alone did it, huh?

30:27.650 --> 30:29.780
I had suspected her, too.

30:30.340 --> 30:32.040
In order to check her identity,

30:32.060 --> 30:33.320
I approached her on purpose.

30:33.340 --> 30:35.560
But I found no sign of collaboration

30:35.580 --> 30:36.500
but saw

30:36.500 --> 30:38.630
how she upheld justice for others.

30:38.650 --> 30:40.760
She had no ulterior motives.

30:40.780 --> 30:42.760
She just wanted to protect her family.

30:42.780 --> 30:44.320
Thanks to her reminder,

30:44.340 --> 30:45.520
I was able to know

30:45.540 --> 30:48.040
an eclipse would happen during the Hunt

30:48.060 --> 30:50.860
and keep you safe.

30:50.890 --> 30:52.250
So,

30:52.580 --> 30:54.730
you knew who she really was?

30:55.020 --> 30:57.060
Look, Brother.

30:57.080 --> 30:57.930
Prince Yan

30:57.930 --> 30:59.520
used to be a decorated general,

30:59.540 --> 31:01.630
but he's been bewitched by this vamp

31:01.650 --> 31:03.760
to disregard his country and family.

31:03.780 --> 31:06.150
Obviously, Nanwu's Saintess

31:06.170 --> 31:08.170
is formidable.

31:08.210 --> 31:10.930
She's able to predict the future

31:11.170 --> 31:13.150
and help restore Nanwu

31:13.170 --> 31:14.100
to destroy Dazhou.

31:14.100 --> 31:15.650
She's a huge threat to us!

31:15.730 --> 31:17.390
We've fought them

31:17.410 --> 31:19.020
for decades.

31:19.100 --> 31:20.800
People have been struggling in war.

31:20.820 --> 31:23.080
They've never had a moment of peace.

31:23.100 --> 31:23.950
Jin,

31:23.970 --> 31:25.320
you and the Chiyu Cavalry

31:25.340 --> 31:26.480
fought over and over

31:26.500 --> 31:28.560
only to hold Nanwu back for a while.

31:28.580 --> 31:29.780
Now, you blindly believe

31:29.780 --> 31:31.520
their Saintess?

31:31.540 --> 31:32.910
Did your soldiers

31:32.930 --> 31:34.630
die for nothing?

31:34.650 --> 31:36.390
Prince Yan has been

31:36.410 --> 31:37.800
blinded to the truth.

31:37.820 --> 31:38.690
I heard

31:38.690 --> 31:41.800
she was best at confusing people's minds.

31:41.820 --> 31:42.840
Your Majesty,

31:42.860 --> 31:44.800
she shall be beheaded immediately

31:44.820 --> 31:45.910
for good!

31:45.930 --> 31:47.710
You're confusing people's minds!

31:47.730 --> 31:49.090
Drag

31:49.620 --> 31:51.540
Jiang Si out and behead her now.

31:51.650 --> 31:53.010
Yes.

31:54.650 --> 31:56.250
I dare you to touch her!

31:58.130 --> 32:01.410
The Saintess appears, Nanwu thrives...

32:13.800 --> 32:16.360
(Peace and Prosperity)

32:16.450 --> 32:17.800
Mother!

32:17.820 --> 32:18.730
Mother, bad news!

32:18.730 --> 32:19.950
Be careful.

32:19.970 --> 32:21.040
They called Princess Yan

32:21.060 --> 32:22.480
Nanwu's Saintess.

32:22.500 --> 32:23.630
Who said that?

32:23.650 --> 32:25.810
When I went to the Tiande Hall
to see Father just now,

32:25.810 --> 32:27.020
I heard that.

32:27.060 --> 32:28.130
No wonder she could

32:28.130 --> 32:29.670
recognize the rare Mang Worm

32:29.690 --> 32:31.480
and cure your eye disease.

32:31.500 --> 32:33.190
She's honest and upright.

32:33.210 --> 32:35.480
I don't believe she's a traitor.

32:35.500 --> 32:37.620
She risked her life to help me.

32:37.690 --> 32:38.540
We can't let her

32:38.540 --> 32:40.020
be wronged like this.

32:41.060 --> 32:42.420
Father,

32:42.620 --> 32:44.300
20 years ago,

32:44.450 --> 32:46.110
you had me exiled

32:46.130 --> 32:47.480
due to false divination.

32:47.500 --> 32:49.260
Now, you're going to kill my love

32:49.260 --> 32:50.870
based on rumor.

32:50.890 --> 32:52.970
I can lead troops into battle

32:53.620 --> 32:55.520
to wipe out Nanwu.

32:55.540 --> 32:57.020
But you're going to kill a girl

32:57.020 --> 32:58.840
in exchange for Dazhou's safety.

32:58.860 --> 33:01.140
Don't you find that absurd, Father?

33:01.340 --> 33:02.700
Yu Jin,

33:03.020 --> 33:04.170
you knew

33:04.170 --> 33:05.080
her identity

33:05.100 --> 33:06.970
but kept covering for her.

33:07.130 --> 33:10.080
Did you come back to Ling'an unauthorized

33:10.100 --> 33:11.710
for a hidden agenda?

33:11.730 --> 33:13.760
Father, you're confusing right and wrong.

33:13.780 --> 33:15.820
I have nothing else to say.

33:20.620 --> 33:22.020
At this stage,

33:22.340 --> 33:24.100
there's no point in hiding it.

33:24.130 --> 33:27.170
Yes, I am Nanwu's Saintess.

33:28.130 --> 33:29.580
Prince Yan,

33:29.890 --> 33:31.450
don't be so naive.

33:31.780 --> 33:33.350
I approached you at first

33:33.370 --> 33:35.630
because I knew you had a special identity.

33:35.650 --> 33:37.150
I figured you'd be

33:37.170 --> 33:38.670
useful to me someday.

33:38.690 --> 33:40.210
Unexpectedly,

33:40.690 --> 33:41.690
all you cared about

33:41.690 --> 33:43.150
was wiping out threats for Dazhou

33:43.170 --> 33:44.690
and pacifying the border.

33:45.020 --> 33:46.460
There was little chance

33:47.170 --> 33:48.800
that you'd help me.

33:48.820 --> 33:50.620
Do you know what you are saying?

33:52.890 --> 33:54.240
Of course I do.

33:54.260 --> 33:55.860
Didn't you approach me

33:56.580 --> 33:58.670
also because you suspected my identity?

33:58.690 --> 34:00.230
I've come this far

34:00.250 --> 34:02.000
as Princess Yan.

34:02.020 --> 34:03.360
It's worth it.

34:03.380 --> 34:04.740
Otherwise,

34:05.850 --> 34:07.620
why would I marry you?

34:07.850 --> 34:09.580
After all,

34:11.420 --> 34:13.140
we were strangers.

34:14.420 --> 34:15.780
Report!

34:17.130 --> 34:18.020
The border's in danger!

34:18.020 --> 34:19.130
Nanwu's massed troops there,

34:19.150 --> 34:20.710
demanding the return of their Saintess.

34:20.730 --> 34:21.770
Otherwise, they will

34:21.770 --> 34:23.170
invade in full force to drown Dazhou

34:23.170 --> 34:24.460
in a bloodbath!

34:24.650 --> 34:26.440
Order Cui Xu to set out immediately

34:26.460 --> 34:28.750
with our troops to meet them there.

34:28.770 --> 34:29.610
Yes.

34:29.620 --> 34:30.960
Your Majesty,

34:30.980 --> 34:33.070
Nanwu believes in their Saintess.

34:33.090 --> 34:34.330
Every generation of their people

34:34.330 --> 34:36.230
is firmly convinced that the Saintess

34:36.250 --> 34:37.480
will help them seize Dazhou.

34:37.500 --> 34:39.830
If we behead her,

34:39.850 --> 34:40.810
the people of Nanwu

34:40.810 --> 34:42.190
will scatter and escape.

34:42.210 --> 34:43.050
Then

34:43.060 --> 34:44.480
no one can

34:44.500 --> 34:46.000
stop our troops

34:46.020 --> 34:46.980
from seizing their land!

34:46.980 --> 34:48.190
Marquis Changxing,

34:48.210 --> 34:49.270
with the enemy in front,

34:49.290 --> 34:51.100
you're risking our people's lives.

34:51.100 --> 34:52.700
Would you rather see war break out?

34:52.720 --> 34:53.570
Your Majesty,

34:53.580 --> 34:54.600
the rumor says

34:54.620 --> 34:57.230
the Saintess embodies Nanwu's belief.

34:57.250 --> 34:58.750
If you kill me,

34:58.770 --> 34:59.730
you'll also destroy

34:59.730 --> 35:00.710
their belief.

35:00.730 --> 35:01.630
In that case,

35:01.650 --> 35:03.440
Nanwu will attack in full fury.

35:03.460 --> 35:05.000
Both Nanwu and Dazhou

35:05.020 --> 35:06.520
will suffer huge losses.

35:06.540 --> 35:08.940
Is that what you want to see, Your Majesty?

35:13.940 --> 35:16.900
Throw her in the Imperial Prison

35:17.150 --> 35:18.020
pending a retrial.

35:18.020 --> 35:19.380
Yes.

35:25.290 --> 35:26.520
Your Majesty,

35:26.540 --> 35:28.080
the truth has come out.

35:28.100 --> 35:29.650
A retrial is unnecessary.

35:29.730 --> 35:32.000
Capital Security solves and tries cases.

35:32.020 --> 35:35.000
Zhen Heng is known to be fair and just.

35:35.020 --> 35:37.810
He'll deal with this case.

35:38.810 --> 35:41.060
Zhen Heng of Capital Security is on it.

35:42.580 --> 35:45.040
Brother, such a major case

35:45.060 --> 35:47.810
should be tried by two offices for fairness.

35:48.500 --> 35:50.710
The Council of State for military affairs

35:50.730 --> 35:53.100
is the most suitable for it.

35:53.580 --> 35:57.330
Zhen Heng and Marquis Changxing

35:57.330 --> 35:59.040
will handle this case together.

35:59.060 --> 36:00.420
You may leave.

36:01.500 --> 36:02.860
Hang back, Jin.

36:04.100 --> 36:05.560
Good day, Your Majesty.

36:23.730 --> 36:25.140
Tell me.

36:26.380 --> 36:29.140
Who am I to you?

36:30.130 --> 36:32.330
The Emperor and my father.

36:33.730 --> 36:35.290
You aren't too hopeless.

36:36.210 --> 36:38.940
I'm the Emperor before I'm your father.

36:39.730 --> 36:41.690
You should know the line

36:42.460 --> 36:45.100
between state affairs and family affairs.

36:45.290 --> 36:47.100
Nanwu firmly believes

36:47.100 --> 36:48.850
Jiang Si is their Saintess.

36:48.980 --> 36:50.310
The rest of her life

36:50.330 --> 36:52.140
can only go two ways.

36:53.060 --> 36:56.170
Either she'll be killed,

36:56.420 --> 36:58.900
or she'll be imprisoned for life

36:58.900 --> 37:00.560
as Nanwu's hostage.

37:00.580 --> 37:02.370
Either way,

37:03.060 --> 37:05.580
she'll no longer be your wife.

37:07.730 --> 37:09.690
It's better

37:09.900 --> 37:11.850
for you to forget her.

37:29.850 --> 37:31.210
Get in!

37:40.460 --> 37:46.040
♪ Life is like flowers,
blooming and fading with the seasons ♪

37:48.500 --> 37:49.860
Jin,

37:50.020 --> 37:52.000
it's no longer a family affair

37:52.020 --> 37:53.500
but a state affair.

37:53.540 --> 37:55.880
You cannot act on impulse again.

37:55.900 --> 37:58.850
♪ To enjoy a blessed life ♪

37:59.130 --> 38:05.400
♪ I only wish to be unburdened ♪

38:05.420 --> 38:11.790
♪ Alas, is it too late
to stop indulging myself ♪

38:11.810 --> 38:18.210
♪ Is the yearning in my heart too distant ♪

38:18.230 --> 38:21.490
♪ The wildflowers bloom across the mountains ♪

38:21.490 --> 38:25.110
♪ Yet I remain trapped ♪

38:25.130 --> 38:30.360
♪ A shared bond, a tragic ending ♪

38:30.380 --> 38:31.920
Given what happened earlier,

38:31.940 --> 38:33.880
Brother's even more vigilant

38:33.900 --> 38:35.940
to Nanwu than I thought.

38:36.250 --> 38:38.420
We can't sit and do nothing.

38:38.460 --> 38:40.540
We shall plan ahead.

38:41.250 --> 38:43.370
I'll do as you say.

38:47.730 --> 38:48.600
Marquis,

38:48.620 --> 38:50.110
did you hate me

38:50.130 --> 38:52.560
for not helping your son out?

38:52.580 --> 38:53.940
I wouldn't dare.

38:54.020 --> 38:55.360
I understand

38:55.380 --> 38:57.060
you had your difficulties.

38:57.900 --> 39:01.190
I'll leave the rest to you, Marquis.

39:01.210 --> 39:02.570
Yes.

39:20.210 --> 39:21.150
Marquis.

39:21.170 --> 39:23.140
Did you get the defense plan

39:23.160 --> 39:24.710
of the Imperial Insignia Guards?

39:24.730 --> 39:26.090
Yes.

39:29.170 --> 39:30.560
Very well.

39:30.580 --> 39:33.060
Gather all our men in secret

39:33.250 --> 39:34.830
and await my order.

39:34.850 --> 39:36.210
Yes.

39:40.600 --> 39:47.240
(Defense Plan)

39:55.130 --> 39:57.060
Son,

39:58.500 --> 40:03.620
I will avenge your death!

40:04.480 --> 40:06.440
(Prince Yan's Mansion)

40:06.770 --> 40:09.250
Search every corner.

40:09.420 --> 40:11.710
Leave no stone unturned.

40:11.730 --> 40:13.170
Whoever finds proof of collaboration

40:13.170 --> 40:15.020
will be rewarded!

40:18.770 --> 40:20.210
What are you doing?

40:21.850 --> 40:23.830
What are you doing, Marquis?

40:23.850 --> 40:26.600
Princess Yan is on suspicion
of collaboration and treason.

40:26.620 --> 40:28.630
As the Commissioner,
I'm ordered to investigate it.

40:28.630 --> 40:30.150
Arrest all of them for interrogation.

40:30.170 --> 40:32.080
Some must've kept secret the news

40:32.100 --> 40:33.020
about Nanwu's Saintess.

40:33.020 --> 40:34.100
Once Prince Yan comes back,

40:34.100 --> 40:34.940
he'll make you pay!

40:34.940 --> 40:36.290
- Seize them all!
- I dare you!

40:36.290 --> 40:37.650
Hold on.

40:48.620 --> 40:50.290
Marquis, are you

40:50.290 --> 40:51.750
handling the case fairly?

40:51.770 --> 40:55.310
It's you again, Mr. Zhen.

40:55.330 --> 40:57.190
This case belongs to our two offices.

40:57.210 --> 40:59.000
Just like you,

40:59.020 --> 41:00.150
I'm here to investigate.

41:00.170 --> 41:01.600
As per the law,

41:01.620 --> 41:02.690
before one's convicted,

41:02.690 --> 41:04.150
except for one's lineal family,

41:04.170 --> 41:06.500
we have no right to arrest anyone.

41:11.580 --> 41:12.830
All of them are

41:12.850 --> 41:14.310
Prince Yan's servants.

41:14.330 --> 41:16.170
They can be arrested by law.

41:16.170 --> 41:17.520
They're civilians we hired.

41:17.540 --> 41:18.920
They didn't sell themselves.

41:18.940 --> 41:19.880
We cannot arrest them.

41:19.900 --> 41:21.500
Keep searching.

41:21.500 --> 41:23.130
I'll have our men search with you.

41:23.130 --> 41:24.250
Who do you think you are?

41:24.250 --> 41:25.380
I'll have you arrested, too!

41:25.380 --> 41:26.480
Wait.

41:26.500 --> 41:27.940
Look carefully.

41:33.500 --> 41:35.750
His Majesty had us work together

41:35.770 --> 41:37.750
on this case to supervise each other

41:37.770 --> 41:38.920
for fairness,

41:38.940 --> 41:40.330
am I right?

41:44.420 --> 41:45.780
Got!

42:12.580 --> 42:13.940
Found it.

42:15.170 --> 42:16.530
Let's go.

42:23.250 --> 42:24.360
Marquis,

42:24.380 --> 42:25.810
here's a secret letter.

42:29.620 --> 42:30.600
Mr. Zhen,

42:30.620 --> 42:31.810
a list of Nanwu's spies

42:31.810 --> 42:34.670
has been found in Prince Yan's Mansion.

42:34.690 --> 42:36.730
No way! It's a set-up!

42:36.730 --> 42:38.150
Here's the evidence.

42:38.170 --> 42:40.730
See for yourself, Mr. Zhen.

42:45.250 --> 42:46.920
Who found this letter?

42:46.940 --> 42:49.100
- I did.
- Answer my question.

42:49.460 --> 42:50.670
Where exactly

42:50.690 --> 42:52.340
did you find this letter?

42:52.360 --> 42:56.640
(The End of Episode 36)

42:57.090 --> 42:58.820
♪ From place to place ♪

42:58.820 --> 43:03.760
♪ I drift in the world alone ♪

43:04.130 --> 43:06.510
♪ The cool breeze comes and goes ♪

43:06.510 --> 43:10.740
♪ I dare to love and hate ♪

43:11.450 --> 43:13.850
♪ Ask the day and the night ♪

43:13.870 --> 43:17.530
♪ If they saw a glimmer fall and take root ♪

43:17.550 --> 43:20.970
♪ Growing between us ♪

43:21.120 --> 43:26.640
♪ And breeding love ♪

43:27.460 --> 43:31.140
♪ Smile at each other for the future ♪

43:31.140 --> 43:35.220
♪ In the end, we're still together ♪

43:35.460 --> 43:37.200
♪ Like shadows ♪

43:37.220 --> 43:41.920
♪ We're brave enough to advance together ♪

43:41.920 --> 43:45.490
♪ We promise each other the future ♪

43:45.510 --> 43:49.740
♪ Our bond trickles down from youth ♪

43:49.760 --> 43:51.540
♪ Time glows ♪

43:51.540 --> 43:56.080
♪ Together, we'll see light ♪

43:56.100 --> 44:00.900
♪ And stars ♪

44:05.130 --> 44:07.660
♪ Don't ask what our fate is ♪

44:07.680 --> 44:11.300
♪ Let life carve the growth rings ♪

44:11.320 --> 44:14.750
♪ We'll reach the end eventually ♪

44:14.770 --> 44:19.390
♪ All will bloom in spring ♪

44:19.390 --> 44:23.080
♪ We promise each other the future ♪

44:23.100 --> 44:27.190
♪ Our bond trickles down from youth ♪

44:27.300 --> 44:29.120
♪ Time glows ♪

44:29.120 --> 44:33.670
♪ Together, we'll see light ♪

44:33.690 --> 44:37.390
♪ Smile at each other for the future ♪

44:37.410 --> 44:41.570
♪ We travel at night in the cold ♪

44:41.750 --> 44:43.510
♪ The moonlight shines like water ♪

44:43.510 --> 44:48.030
♪ Those in love will have sweet dreams ♪

44:48.030 --> 44:51.670
♪ Cherish each other in the future ♪

44:51.690 --> 44:57.360
♪ Time goes by, but memories remain ♪

44:59.050 --> 45:00.980
♪ Take a look to remember everything ♪

45:00.980 --> 45:08.480
♪ We will see flowers fill the city again ♪
